<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65588" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεθάλλομαι</span></b> , used by <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> only in 
			Ep.
		
		aor.
		part.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετάλμενος</span>:— <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leap, rush upon</i>, of warriors, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτασε . . μετάλμενος ὀξέϊ δουρί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.336
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτασε δουρὶ μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					14.443
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τρώεσσι μ. ἐν φόβον ὦρσε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.362
				</span></i>
			; of a lion, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥρπαξε μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					12.305
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				10.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>rush after</i>, in a race, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἔσθ᾽ ὅς κέ σ᾽ ἕλησι μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.345
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>leap from</i> one ship <i>to another</i> in a sea-fight, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς ἀλλήλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					5.120
				</span></i>
			; <i>spring from side to side, hither and thither</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾷ καὶ τᾷ τὸν Ἔρωτα μετάλμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Bion
					<u>Fr.</u>
					10.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				6.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				22.269c
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
